Logistik regressiya qaysi turdagi masala uchun?
A) Regressiya
B) Tasniflash
C) Klasterlash
ANSWER: B

Sigmoid funksiyasining qiymatlari qaysi oraliqda?
A) -1 dan 1 gacha
B) 0 dan 1 gacha
C) 0 dan cheksizgacha
ANSWER: B

Tasniflash chegarasini 0.5 dan 0.3 ga tushirsak nima bo'ladi?
A) Ko'proq obyekt 1-sinf deb topiladi
B) Kamroq obyekt 1-sinf deb topiladi
C) Hech narsa o'zgarmaydi
ANSWER: A
